OL,3,GNEWSACycle jumps dug into
OL,4,Aarchaeological site
OL,5,
OL,6,FCyclists have caused "significant
OL,7,Fdamage" to protected woodland in
OL,8,FWarwickshire that hosts important
OL,9,Farchaeological and historical remains.
OL,11,FOfficers said a "substantial network of
OL,12,Fdirt jumps and tracks" had been
OL,13,Fconstructed by excavating soil
OL,14,Fthroughout the Glasshouse Woods in
OL,15,FKenilworth.
OL,17,FWarwickshire Police Rural Crime Team
OL,18,Fsaid the area had "archaeological and
OL,19,Fhistorical significance" associated
OL,20,Fwith Roman-period settlement and
OL,21,Factivity about 2,000 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
