OL,3,GNEWSACycle jumps dug into
OL,4,Aarchaeological site
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the scale of the jumps and
OL,7,Ftracks suggested "considerable time and
OL,8,Feffort has been spent altering the
OL,9,Flandscape" and potentially "causing
OL,10,Firreversible damage to important
OL,11,Farchaeological remains".
